{"type":"text","timestamp":1790377217985,"sessionID":"ses_f25397d88ffeKPWpj48HGyWr0Y","part":{"id":"prt_0dacc4fad001jQeCdg5kEkGQQX","messageID":"msg_0dacc13ef001fdlbD5Er5inFB8","sessionID":"ses_f25397d88ffeKPWpj48HGyWr0Y","type":"text","text":"The completed scripts run without errors in Godot 4.4.1. I’m now checking fast-release protection, right-click cancellation and card order, invalid drops, and removal on a valid drop. I’ll also capture the rendered drag and restored hand.","time":{"start":1790377217965,"end":1790377217969},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_01cfb33f4459451f016ab6fd01148087d083e593fcf1710b23","phase":"commentary"}}}}
